      "rev_n_1_f18ef1_1": {
        "revision_id": "rev_n_1_f18ef1_1",
        "node_id": "n_1_f18ef1",
        "thought_text": "Dynamic Programming Approach with Correct Backtracking\n\nThe dynamic programming approach needs to correctly track the maximum difficulty encountered so far and backtrack to determine the optimal distribution of problems across days. The issue lies in how the `last_max` array is updated and used to backtrack. We need to ensure that `last_max` accurately reflects the last position where the maximum difficulty was seen up to each point, and use it to reconstruct the optimal distribution efficiently.",
        "parent_revision_path_hash": "5740354900026072187",
        "replaces_revision_id": "rev_n_1_f18ef1_0",
        "feedback_id": "fb_6494a44a24",
        "created_at": 1794499728.8337407
      },
      "rev_n_2_22b4b3_1": {
        "revision_id": "rev_n_2_22b4b3_1",
        "node_id": "n_2_22b4b3",
        "thought_text": "Dynamic Programming Approach\n\nConsider using dynamic programming to keep track of the maximum profit up to each day and the corresponding distribution of problems. This approach allows us to efficiently compute the optimal solution by breaking down the problem into smaller subproblems and combining their solutions.",
        "parent_revision_path_hash": "5740354900026072187",
        "replaces_revision_id": "rev_n_2_22b4b3_0",
        "feedback_id": "fb_94772c90cd",
        "created_at": 1794499748.7020628
      },
      "rev_n_3_96926d_1": {
        "revision_id": "rev_n_3_96926d_1",
        "node_id": "n_3_96926d",
        "thought_text": "Sliding Window Technique with Dynamic Programming",
        "parent_revision_path_hash": "5740354900026072187",
        "replaces_revision_id": "rev_n_3_96926d_0",
        "feedback_id": "fb_68fdf3a21b",
        "created_at": 1794499773.5536246
      },
      "rev_n_4_579a23_0": {
        "revision_id": "rev_n_4_579a23_0",
        "node_id": "n_4_579a23",
        "thought_text": "Revisit the DP table construction to ensure correct handling of the last_max array updates.",
